  (text "Power: dev-board USB, or J1 M8 pins 1 and 3 when USB is unplugged. Never feed the 3V3 pin." (at 8.89 6.35 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid bc222f2a-1bb3-472a-be06-61cc33ca1e1d)
  )
  (text "M8 pin 1: F1 MF-R110, D2 P6KE6.8A, D1 1N5822 (anode at M8) into the dev-board 5V pin = +5V_SPS = SPS30 VDD." (at 8.89 8.89 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid f5ab6c68-f6f6-465b-a63c-53aa93175489)
  )
  (text "M8 pin 2 VBAT 2.7-4.6 V: D3 P6KE6.8A, R10/R11 1.00M/1.00M, C10 100n. ADC = VBAT/2 (4.6 V -> 2.30 V, 6.2 V -> 3.10 V)." (at 8.89 11.43 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 8041742f-96ee-4005-af3d-c6ed9c6c73d0)
  )
  (text "M8 pin 4 VSOL up to 22 V: D4 P6KE30A, R12/R13 1.80M/200k, C11 100n. ADC = VSOL/10 (22 V -> 2.20 V, 25 V -> 2.50 V, 31 V -> 3.10 V)." (at 8.89 13.97 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid c8c02d41-1d6a-4c78-bd70-cd6113ae83bc)
  )
  (text "J2 and J3 are the two USB-jack VBUS pads, before the DevKitC-1 1N5819s. Not the 5V header." (at 8.89 16.51 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 6959c079-4eb3-4313-87db-82d6cbb493aa)
  )
  (text "Firmware reads A_VBAT and A_VSOL, and reports both as 0 while USBDET is above 1.2 V." (at 8.89 19.05 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid a1643af7-cd52-4e13-b439-08bdeb7c6cb4)
  )
  (text "DevKitC-1 / AI-S3: 5V pin is after the onboard Schottky. 3V3 pin is the onboard LDO." (at 8.89 21.59 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid e32a7fa7-6b79-4b55-86ba-ef5fc47e6be1)
  )
  (text "SDA GPIO8, SCL GPIO9. VBAT GPIO6, VSOL GPIO7, USB detect GPIO10. N16R8 quad flash, octal PSRAM." (at 8.89 24.13 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 8f2b51f6-3a1b-4030-b2c2-90ea9ee836e5)
  )
  (text "I2C is 100 kHz at 3.3 V. R1 and R2 are 4.7k to +3V3. Fit U4 or U5, not both. U6 SEL to GND before power-up." (at 8.89 26.67 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 2a3f582c-0ef0-407c-9d68-e3d43c63329e)
  )
  (text "Leave open: GPIO0/3/45/46 (strap), GPIO19/20 (USB), GPIO43/44 (UART), GPIO33-37 (octal PSRAM), GPIO48 (RGB)." (at 8.89 29.21 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 84a2756c-2e28-4ad1-a782-7f15907a6a11)
